[{"answer":"Hello, Tourist Information Centre, Mike speaking, how can I help you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-1-2023-02-13-11-43-39/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, hi.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-1-2023-02-13-11-43-39/2.mp3"},{"answer":"I wanted to find out about cookery classes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-1-2023-02-13-11-43-39/3.mp3"},{"answer":"I believe there are some one-day classes for tourists?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-1-2023-02-13-11-43-39/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, they're open to everyone, but tourists are always welcome.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-1-2023-02-13-11-43-39/5.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, let me give you some details of what's available.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-1-2023-02-13-11-43-39/6.mp3"},{"answer":"There are several classes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-1-2023-02-13-11-43-39/7.mp3"},{"answer":"One very popular one is at the Food Studio.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-1-2023-02-13-11-43-39/8.mp3"},{"answer":"OK","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-1-2023-02-13-11-43-39/9.mp3"},{"answer":"They focus on seasonal products,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-1-2023-02-13-11-43-39/10.mp3"},{"answer":"and as well as teaching you how to cook them, they also show you how to choose them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-1-2023-02-13-11-43-39/11.mp3"},{"answer":"Right, that sounds good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-1-2023-02-13-11-43-39/12.mp3"},{"answer":"How big are the classes?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-1-2023-02-13-11-43-39/13.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm not sure exactly, but they'll be quite small.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-1-2023-02-13-11-43-39/14.mp3"},{"answer":"And could I get a private lesson there?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-1-2023-02-13-11-43-39/15.mp3"},{"answer":"I think so... let me check,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-1-2023-02-13-11-43-39/16.mp3"},{"answer":"yes, they do offer those.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-1-2023-02-13-11-43-39/17.mp3"},{"answer":"Though in fact most of the people who attend the classes find it's a nice way of getting to know one another.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-1-2023-02-13-11-43-39/18.mp3"},{"answer":"I suppose it must be, yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-1-2023-02-13-11-43-39/19.mp3"},{"answer":"And this company has a special deal for clients","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-1-2023-02-13-11-43-39/20.mp3"},{"answer":"where they offer a discount of 20% if you return for a further class.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-1-2023-02-13-11-43-39/21.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-1-2023-02-13-11-43-39/22.mp3"},{"answer":"But you said there were several classes?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-1-2023-02-13-11-43-39/23.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-1-2023-02-13-11-43-39/24.mp3"},{"answer":"Another one you might be interested in is Bond's Cookery School.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-1-2023-02-13-11-43-39/25.mp3"},{"answer":"They're quite new,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-1-2023-02-13-11-43-39/26.mp3"},{"answer":"they just opened six months ago, but I've heard good things about them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-1-2023-02-13-11-43-39/27.mp3"},{"answer":"They concentrate on teaching you to prepare healthy food,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-1-2023-02-13-11-43-39/28.mp3"},{"answer":"and they have quite a lot of specialist staff.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-1-2023-02-13-11-43-39/29.mp3"},{"answer":"So is that food for people on a diet and things like that?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-1-2023-02-13-11-43-39/30.mp3"},{"answer":"I don't know if I'd be interested in that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-1-2023-02-13-11-43-39/31.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I don't think they particularly focus on low calorie diets or weight loss.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-1-2023-02-13-11-43-39/32.mp3"},{"answer":"It's more to do with recipes that look at specific needs,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-1-2023-02-13-11-43-39/33.mp3"},{"answer":"like including ingredients that will help build up your bones and make them stronger, that sort of thing.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-1-2023-02-13-11-43-39/34.mp3"},{"answer":"I see.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-1-2023-02-13-11-43-39/35.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I might be interested, I'm not sure.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-1-2023-02-13-11-43-39/36.mp3"},{"answer":"Do they have a website I could check?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-1-2023-02-13-11-43-39/37.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, just key in the name of the school - it'll come up.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-1-2023-02-13-11-43-39/38.mp3"},{"answer":"And if you want to know more about them, every Thursday evening they have a lecture at the school.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-1-2023-02-13-11-43-39/39.mp3"},{"answer":"It's free and you don't need to book or anything, just turn up at 7.30.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-1-2023-02-13-11-43-39/40.mp3"},{"answer":"And that might give you an idea of whether you want to go to an actual class.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-1-2023-02-13-11-43-39/41.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, there's one more place you might be interested in.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-1-2023-02-13-11-43-39/42.mp3"},{"answer":"That's got a rather strange name, it's called The Arretsa Centre -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-1-2023-02-13-11-43-39/43.mp3"},{"answer":"that's spelled ARRETSA.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-1-2023-02-13-11-43-39/44.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-1-2023-02-13-11-43-39/45.mp3"},{"answer":"They've got a very good reputation.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-1-2023-02-13-11-43-39/46.mp3"},{"answer":"They do a bit of meat and fish cookery but they mostly specialise in vegetarian dishes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-1-2023-02-13-11-43-39/47.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-1-2023-02-13-11-43-39/48.mp3"},{"answer":"That's certainly an area I'd like to learn more about.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-1-2023-02-13-11-43-39/49.mp3"},{"answer":"I've got lots of friends who don't eat meat.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-1-2023-02-13-11-43-39/50.mp3"},{"answer":"In fact, I think I might have seen that school today.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-1-2023-02-13-11-43-39/51.mp3"},{"answer":"Is it just by the market?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-1-2023-02-13-11-43-39/52.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-1-2023-02-13-11-43-39/53.mp3"},{"answer":"So they don't have any problem getting their ingredients.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-1-2023-02-13-11-43-39/54.mp3"},{"answer":"They're right next door.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-1-2023-02-13-11-43-39/55.mp3"},{"answer":"And they also offer a special two-hour course in how to use a knife.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-1-2023-02-13-11-43-39/56.mp3"},{"answer":"They cover all the different skills - buying them, sharpening, chopping techniques.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-1-2023-02-13-11-43-39/57.mp3"},{"answer":"It gets booked up quickly though so you'd need to check it was available.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-1-2023-02-13-11-43-39/58.mp3"},{"answer":"Right, well thank you very much.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-1-2023-02-13-11-43-39/59.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll go and...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-1-part-1-2023-02-13-11-43-39/60.mp3"}]
